    "text": "If the reciprocals of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mn>4</mn></math> are in arithmetic progression, then <math><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to"
